  offerLine: You've got an eye for this. Bring me four good lengths of silk and I'll show you what I know. In fact, I'll come along. I'm sick of this trunk.
  activeLine: Four lengths. Fresh, mind.
  readyLine: Good. You're a natural, which is annoying. I'll come foraging. I'll tell you where the silk is, and how to carry more. And here are some more lights. Don't thank me.
  doneLine: Have you considered more lanterns?
